# Chinese planning / review / decomposition naming conventions
*规划*.md
*计划*.md
*审查*.md
*拆解*.md
*分析*.md
*复盘*.md
*草稿*.md

# Working / scratch directories
dev-notes/
scratch/
planning/
drafts/
notes/
working/

# Workbuddy / ZCode workspace metadata (workspace-level, not project source)
.workbuddy/
.zcode/

# Editor / OS temp + backup files
*.bak
*.tmp
*.orig
*.rej
*.swp
*.swo
*~

# Python
__pycache__/
*.py[cod]
*.egg-info/
dist/
build/

# Virtual environments
.venv/
venv/

# Tool caches
.pytest_cache/
.ruff_cache/
.mypy_cache/
.coverage
coverage.xml
htmlcov/
.dist/
.pytest-junit.xml

# Environment & secrets (never commit)
.env
.env.local

# Internal planning documents (public docs live in docs/ and ARE tracked)
docs/plans/

# Editor/IDE + workspace assistant metadata
.idea/
.trae/

# Local state (checkpointer db) + runtime logs + local test artifacts
*.db
*.db-shm
*.db-wal
*.sqlite3
*.log
gui-test-screenshots/
.extreme-fixtures/

# ZCode workspace file-watch rules (auto-synced FROM .gitignore by the tool)
.zcodeignore

# OS
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
